  "nano_banana_pro_prompt": {
    "prompt": "Create a detailed layered architecture diagram showing the Engram Memory Enrichment Workflow. The diagram should show how sessions, episodes, stories, and chat interactions work together to automatically enrich Zep memory through agent interactions.\\n\\nLayout: Use a layered architecture with 4 layers:\\n1. Interaction Layer (top): User and Frontend (React + MSAL)\\n2. API Layer: Chat API, Voice API, Story API\\n3. Processing Layer: Enrich Context (RAG), Agent (Elena/Marcus/Sage), Story Workflow (Temporal), Manual Ingestion\\n4. Memory Layer (bottom): Zep Session, Zep Episode, Entities & Facts, Zep Search, Story Memory, Persist Conversation\\n\\nFlow A (Chat/Voice - RAG Pattern):\\n- User → Frontend → Chat/Voice API → Enrich Context (searches Zep Search) → Agent (with memory context) → Response → Persist Conversation (background) → Zep Session\\n\\nFlow B (Story Creation):\\n- User → Frontend → Story API → Story Workflow (Temporal) → Story Memory → Zep Search (searchable)\\n\\nFlow C (Auto-processing):\\n- Zep Session → Auto-creates Zep Episodes (semantic segmentation)\\n- Zep Session → Auto-extracts Entities & Facts\\n\\nFlow D (Manual Ingestion):\\n- Manual Ingestion (MCP Tool) → Zep Session\\n\\nKey Annotations:\\n- RAG Pattern: Searches existing memory before each response\\n- Automatic Persistence: Every turn saved to memory (background task)\\n- Zep automatically segments sessions into episodes\\n- Hybrid Search: Semantic + Keyword + Metadata (RRF)\\n\\nUse a dark theme with cyan (#00d4ff) for memory/data elements, green (#10b981) for RAG/persistence flows, purple (#a855f7) for story workflows, and orange (#f59e0b) for agents/manual processes. Make connections animated where data flows actively (RAG, persistence). Use dashed lines for automatic/background processes.",
    "output_requirements": {
      "diagram_type": "layered architecture + flow",
      "detail_level": "high",
      "include_annotations": true,
      "include_legend": true,
      "show_data_flow": true,
      "highlight_automatic_processes": true,
      "color_coding": {
        "memory_elements": "#00d4ff",
        "rag_flows": "#10b981",
        "story_workflows": "#a855f7",
        "agents": "#f59e0b",
        "api_endpoints": "#6366f1"
      }
    }
  }
}

